{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113435","id":3062560686,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc62iveu","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113435","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113435.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113435.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113435","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113435/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113435/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113435/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/be5897bee2e81454f31bb562629cb9e356e1c6e7","number":113435,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix crash by shortcut setting in project manager","user":{"login":"xuhuisheng","id":1118508,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMTg1MDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1118508?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng","html_url":"https://github.com/xuhuisheng","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- *Fixes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113361*\r\n\r\n## Issue Description\r\n\r\nWhen setting shortcuts in project manager, we used `EditorUndoRedoManager`. But `EditorUndoRedoManager` didn't init in project manager.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/f5918a9d35350bf6402dd1b4902ab539747d77a6/editor/settings/editor_settings_dialog.cpp#L345-L353\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\n\r\nFirst, allocate memory for `EditorUndoRedoManager` in project manager.\r\n\r\nSecond, check whether `EditorNode` is nullptr for preventing null pointer crashing. \r\n\r\n[project-setting.webm](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4b1d2704-0c91-489d-8d40-2a148dfef048)\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","description":"","color":"885544","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-12-02T08:34:23Z","updated_at":"2026-02-07T12:36:18Z","closed_at":"2025-12-03T01:47:32Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"99831c89f22b0ad3150425add9c197b1d8d916cb","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.git